<title>SPAIN: BBV creates European private banking unit.</title>
<headline>BBV creates European private banking unit.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Bilbao Vizcaya (BBV) said on Wednesday it had created a new unit, Banca Privada Europa, which will provide overall private banking services on a European level.</p>
<p>The new unit is aimed at the &quot;top segment&quot; of clients and will be headed by the Privanza subsidiary, a note said.</p>
<p>BBV has also created a Latin American private banking arm, Banca Privada America, to carry out the same task across the Atlantic.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
